ready for Rodney-slaying, and goes through her standard make-sure-I-have-
everyhing check, since finding that one thing you're missing when the Wiz
is pursuing you just stinks.

So, it's
All the important intrinsics, check.
Good, fully enchanted armor, including gloves, check.
Magicbane, check.
Sufficient food for the endgame, check.
Holy water, check.
Oilskin sack, check.
Rings of free action and levitation, check.
Wands of death and digging, check.
Spellbooks of identify, magic missile, cone of cold, dig, remove curse,
and teleport, check.
Throwing daggers, check.
Crystal ball, check.
The Eye of Misspelling, check.
The bell and candleabrum, check.
Candles..........candles.......d'oh!

Of course, she had burned all her wishes at the point, and Minetown had
one (1) tallow candle to offer, and she had found a grand total of one
