All the thrones I've already sat on.  Drink all the fountains in the game.
Still nothing.  Smoky potions are gain energy, I've already used all those
up.

Thus, I spent something on the order of 6,000 turns racing around the mines
and main dungeon, collecting every tool of unihorn size or smaller and 
transporting them to Sokoban (my home base).  A soldier on Dlev 25 was
nice enough to leave me a ?ofCharging.  Wand of polymorph
goes to (1:6).

